  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When all avatars are visible and havent been reloaded in a long time, the game will start to lag a lot for unknown reasons. Toggling safety mode to PANIC_SAFE and then back to NONE (or whatever your previous setting is) seems to greatly reduce lag. This can be tested in places like full lobbies of Never Have I Ever or Murder worlds. If you start lagging a lot for no reason this seems to fix it. Perhaps it has something to do with avatar based memory leaks or computation issues.",
